 ency/Period/RMS\nETA/CETa SCOPE: 2.8–2.12.2\; 4.2–4.4\; 9.3\; 9.7\nCAR
 EER/EMBEDDED PURPOSE: RC timing\, decoupling\, inductive behavior\, wavefo
