  this event\, you should be able to explain or demonstrate:\n• Describe 
 sine waves and basic AC quantities: amplitude\, peak\, peak-to-peak\, freq
 uency\, period\, phase\, and RMS.\n• Convert between frequency and perio
 d and interpret waveform measurements.\n• Explain how capacitors and ind
 uctors store energy and oppose changes in voltage or current.\n• Describ
 e RC and RL transient behavior and the idea of a time constant.\n\nCOVERAG
