 t\, you should be able to explain or demonstrate:\n• Calculate basic XL\
 , XC\, impedance/ratio/resonance relationships at the assigned CETa depth.
 \n• Predict how changing frequency changes circuit behavior.\n• Explai
 n transformer turns ratio\, voltage/current relationships\, isolation\, an
 d basic loading ideas.\n\nCOVERAGE AUDIT\nThe assigned resources and tasks
