 Common_Formulas.pdf\n\nMASTERY GATE: calculate reactance/resonance\, class
 ify an RLC network\, explain transformer step-up/down and crystal/oscillat
 or purpose\, and interpret a simple filter response.\n\nSYSTEM RULES: Watc
 hing alone never counts. Use learn-> retrieve -> calculate/code -> build/m
 easure -> debug -> document. Start each non-exam study block with ~10 minu
