 competency wording + current ETA errata control whenever the older book di
 ffers or omits a current topic.\n\nAFTER TODAY — REQUIRED LEARNING OUTCO
 MES (WEEK 08)\nBy the end of this event\, you should be able to explain or
  demonstrate:\n• Explain PN junction behavior and the operation/use of r
 ectifier diodes\, LEDs\, Zener diodes\, and protection diodes.\n• Explai
 n BJT switching at a practical level and distinguish NPN/PNP behavior.\n
 • Explain FET/MOSFET gate control\, source/drain roles\, logic-level swi
 tching\, and common protection concerns.\n• Recognize SCR/TRIAC purpose 
 and where controlled switching devices are used.\n\nCOVERAGE AUDIT\nThe as
 signed resources and tasks above are intended to cover every item in this 
