 .5\nCAREER/EMBEDDED PURPOSE: Binary/hex\, truth tables\, TTL/CMOS levels\,
  flip-flops\, counters\, clocks\, buses\, pull-ups/pull-downs and floating
  inputs.\n\nTHIS WEEK'S RESOURCES:\n- Digital Electronics — ALL ABOUT EL
