 /playlist?list=PLBlnK6fEyqRjMH3mWf6kwqiTbT798eAOm\n\nMASTERY GATE: Convert
  number systems\, build truth tables\, explain TTL/CMOS levels and sequent
 ial devices\, and diagnose a floating-input/logic-state fault.\n\nSYSTEM R
 ULES: Watching alone nevercounts. Use learn -> retrieve -> calculate/code 
