 valent ARM/STM32-class board\, correct USB data cable\, STM32Cube IDE inst
 allation\, debugger access (on-board ST-LINK is fine when available)\, bre
 adboard/jumpers\, and a known-good LED/button path.\n\n\nTODAY — ACTION 
