 ode.\n• Explain const\, volatile\, macros\, headers/modules\, and compil
 er warnings in embedded C.\n• Distinguish blocking from nonblocking beha
 vior.\n\nCOVERAGE AUDIT\nThe assigned resources and tasks above are intend
