 alyzer + Sensors/Actuators\nETA/CETa SCOPE: 12.5\; 13.5/13.7–13.12\; 8.1
 0–8.12 reinforcement\nCAREER/EMBEDDED PURPOSE: One real I2C or SPI perip
 heral\, bus capture\, pull-ups/chip-select/clocking\, sensor units\, PWM/o
 utput control.\n\nTHIS WEEK'S RESOURCES:\n- I2C Tutorial — SparkFun: htt
 ps://learn.sparkfun.com/tutorials/i2c/all\n- SPI Tutorial — SparkFun: ht
 tps://learn.sparkfun.com/tutorials/serial-peripheral-interface-spi/all\n- 
 Saleae support: https://support.saleae.com/\n\nMASTERY GATE: Implement one
