 113–119 + Ch.21 pp.182–187 + Ch.9 optical-semiconductor section pp.76
 –77.\nQUIZ / REVIEW: Ch.14 quiz p.119 + Ch.21 quiz p.187.\nWHY: Uses the
  book for transmission/cabling and technician procedures\; current ETA/vid
 eo crosswalk fills fiber/audio-video gaps not covered as dedicated chapter
 s.\nSOURCE RULE: The 6th-edition book is the primary CETa textbook. Curren
