 b.io/alfred-university/resources.html\nCAREER CONNECTION: Broad CETa gener
 al-electronics coverage plus mixed-domain troubleshooting.\nRESOURCE PRIOR
 ITY: CETa Core → Career Core → Deep Dive. Complete the required work f
 irst\; use Deep Dive for repair or extra depth.\n\nWEEK 20 FOCUS: CETa-Spe
 cific Compression: RF + Telecom + Technician Procedures\nETA/CETa SCOPE: 1
 9.1–19.11\; 20.1–20.5\; 21.1–21.9\nCAREER/EMBEDDED PURPOSE: Exam-foc
 used RF/telecom plus documentation\, test planning\, parts research\, help
 -desk escalation and project discipline.\n\nTHIS WEEK'S RESOURCES:\n- Basi
 cs of Antennas: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n8_iSL4xKj8\n- Introductio
 n to Modulation: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mHvV_Tv8HDQ\n- Radio Fund
 amentals / LMR: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wuni9mHWjnE\n\nMASTERY GAT
 E: explain propagation/modulation/SWR/wavelength/network basics and comple
 te a technician-work scenario set with correct documentation and escalatio
 n choices.\n\nSYSTEM RULES: Watching alone never counts. Use learn ->retri
 eve -> calculate/code -> build/measure -> debug -> document. start each no
 n-exam study block with ~10 minutes of spaced recall. Never use a missed s
 ession as justification for an unhealthy make-up marathon.\n\nTODAY:\nFirs
 t 10 min: spaced recall from prior weeks. Study this week’s scoped mater
 ial and make a one-page memory summary. Complete8–12 fresh CETa question
 s when ETA content applies. School work takes priority during exam-heavy w
 eeks.\n\nREFERENCE HUB — KEEP THESE LINKS:\n• Official Associate CET S
 tudy Guide\, 6th ed.: use your scanned/Google Drive copy and the PRINTED p
 age numbers in BOOK ASSIGNMENT.\n• ETA 6th-ed. errata: https://www.etai.
 org/6thEdASTErrataSheet.pdf\n\nOFFICIAL STUDY GUIDE — V6 BOOK ASSIGNMENT
 \nREAD / USE: Ch.13 pp.104–112 + Ch.15 pp.120–130 + Ch.22 pp.188–193
 .\nQUIZ / REVIEW: Ch.13 quiz p.112\, Ch.15 quiz p.130\, Unit 6 review p.13
