 p misses. CETa green light requires ≥85% on twofull runs\; otherwise con
 tinue weak-area repair.\n\nCETa PRACTICE READINESS GATE — ADVANCE/REPEAT
  DECISION: GREEN = mastery is demonstrable and you advance. YELLOW = advan
 ce but carry no more than 1–2 specific weak items forward with a short w
 ritten repair date. RED = a core/safety/practical gap is material\; use th
 e next available buffer/repair block before treating the gate as complete.
  The calendar date never overrides competence.\n\nREFERENCE HUB — KEEP T
