 eak areas using exact competency evidence.\n• Translate a real embedded 
 project idea into clear requirements and acceptance criteria.\n• Create 
 a block diagram\, interface list\, pin map\, BOM\, and initial test plan.\
 n• Control Project 1 scope so it proves bridge-job skills without featur
 e creep.\n• Explain how each Project 1 feature maps to a readiness-check
 list skill.\n• Use current CETa practice performance to decide whether e
 xam readiness is green\, yellow\, or red.\n\nCOVERAGE AUDIT\nThe assigned 
