 rganize the Project 1 repository\, folders\, README skeleton\, issue list\
 , and evidence locations.\n• Prepare the bench\, board\, cables\, instru
 ments\, firmware toolchain\, and parts for controlled bring-up.\n• Confi
 rm Project 1 requirements\, interfaces\, test cases\, and safety limits be
 fore powering hardware.\n\nCOVERAGE AUDIT\nThe assigned resources and task
 s above are intended to cover every item in this outcome list. If you stil
 l cannot explain or demonstrate one of these items after the session\, do 
