 ns.\n• Prepare the bench\, board\, cables\, instruments\, firmware toolc
 hain\, and parts for controlled bring-up.\n• Confirm Project 1 requireme
 nts\, interfaces\, test cases\, and safety limits before powering hardware
 .\n• Distinguish 'ready to build' from 'still collecting resources.'\n
 • Begin Project 1 with a reproducible\, documented setup.\n\nCOVERAGE AU
