SUMMARY:W24 • Project 1 Lab — Hardware Bring-Up Evidence
DESCRIPTION:ALFRED UNIVERSITY | AU-ESET 301\n\nALFRED STUDY PATH — OPEN T
 HESE WHEN YOU NEED THEM\n• Week module: https://numberclaw2.github.io/al
 fred-university/week.html?week=24\n• Search this topic: https://numbercl
 aw2.github.io/alfred-university/search.html?q=Project%201%20Hardware%20Bri
