 , you should be able to explain or demonstrate:\n• Practice technical an
 d behavioral interviews using real project/troubleshooting stories.\n• T
 rack interview misses and convert them into dated learning repairs.\n• M
 aintain the portfolio while applying without restarting the entire curricu
 lum.\n• Use market feedback to refine role targeting while preserving th
 e embedded-systems trajectory.\n\nCOVERAGE AUDIT\nThe assigned resources a
 nd tasks above are intended to cover every item in this outcome list. If y
 ou still cannot explain or demonstrate one of these items after the sessio
 n\, do not count that item as complete. Write the concept on a short catch
 -up list and use the linked official or supplemental resource before closi
 ng the gap.\n\nSIMPLE COMPLETION RULE\nFinish the assigned work\, then che
 ck the learning outcomes below. If you cannot explain or demonstrate an ou
 tcome\, write that one concept on a short catch-up list and repair it duri
 ng the next available review block. No spreadsheet logging is required.
